{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Change 2202 remains the only Gerrit change for this session. CI run 32782619452 is in progress, with the macOS Python 3.13 job pending. The connected probe scripts import the Jira adapter package but call module-level members that do not exist. AcliClient owns those capabilities. No edits or pushes will occur until CI reaches a terminal state. The correction will use a process-level RED oracle and a held-out GREEN implementation."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787611298176178001,"uuid":"12df7d4a-d4f1-49e6-95af-5a96bf604c67"}